{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"CLSA-2026-1790949439","published":"2026-10-02T13:57:37Z","modified":"2026-10-26T09:31:53.674135079Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-93586","CVE-2026-93587","CVE-2026-93588"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-93586, CVE-2026-93587, CVE-2026-93588","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: use-after-free in ImagesToBlob() when writing a\n     multi-image list to an in-memory blob\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-93586.patch: add SyncBlobStream() and call it\n       after WriteImage()/WriteImages() so the owner image and image info\n       track the live blob buffer, in magick/blob.c, magick/blob-private.h\n       and magick/constitute.c\n     - CVE-2026-93586\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: resource policy bypass in the PCD and HALD coders\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-93587.patch: check the list-length resource\n       limit before cloning image_info->scene frames, in coders/pcd.c and\n       coders/hald.c\n     - CVE-2026-93587\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: NULL pointer dereference in the PNM coder\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-93588.patch: check the comment buffer for NULL\n       before using it, in PNMComment() and ReadPNMImage() in coders/pnm.c\n     - CVE-2026-93588","affected":[{"package":{"name":"imagemagick","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/imagemagick?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8:6.9.10.23+dfsg-2.1+deb10u7+tuxcare.els20"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1790949439.json"}},{"package":{"name":"imagemagick-6-common","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/imagemagick-6-common?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8:6.9.10.23+dfsg-2.1+deb10u7+tuxcare.els20"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1790949439.json"}},{"package":{"name":"imagemagick-6-